<div class="mandarin-hanzi">没关系</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">méi guānxi</div>

''Meaning:'' it’s all right; no problem  
''Part of speech:'' expression

!! In context
没关系，我们还有时间。 — Méi guānxi, wǒmen hái yǒu shíjiān. — It’s all right; we still have time.

!! Usage note
The final syllable of 关系 is commonly neutral.
